al CTAs, social proof\n- `Features` \u2014 6-card grid with Lucide icons\n- `FeatureHighlight` \u2014 3 alternating deep feature blocks\n- `Testimonials` \u2014 placeholder testimonials (clearly marked)\n- `Pricing` \u2014 3-tier with annual/monthly toggle\n- `Footer` \u2014 4-column with social links\n\nTech stack used: Next.js 15, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, next-themes. Dark mode defaults to dark. Accent color (`#7C6FFF`) is a single CSS variable for easy swapping. Product screenshots are clearly marked placeholders ready to swap in.\n\nImplementation notes and pre-launch checklist are at `projects/neutral/output/2026-03-30-implementation-notes.md`.", "\u2713 Done  ($0.9412)"], "done": true}